{
 "_doc": "GENERATED by tools/read_kinzie_addition_lots.py — do not hand-edit. Which of Kinzie's Addition's cells Wright rules into lots on his 1834 survey, where the rules fall, and which cells he leaves whole. This file authors no ground: tools/generate_plat_lots.py cuts the lots on it.",
 "ticket": "T-1741",
 "settles": "the `lot_subdivision_withheld` T-1437 wrote onto every Addition block — `data/traces/vectors/thompson_lots.json` § kinzies_addition — which named this reading as the thing that would settle it",
